  <item>
    <title>反社会人格孙割为何爱妈又恨妈？孙宇晨命盘深度解析</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a92e1c6f03e74ee6b01c434</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a92e1c6f03e74ee6b01c434</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 13:49:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目主播串台“</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/611c9d18a45acc2ae7b0568a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/611c9d18a45acc2ae7b0568a"><strong><span>安全出口FM</span></strong></a><span>”，带大家一起看清孙宇晨的真实人格底色和行为动机，明明白白吃瓜！</span></p><p><strong><span>事业财运/学业/感情婚姻一对一咨询，学习星盘课程，可添加主播联系方式SSSZX333；更多视频内容欢迎关注主播b站“</span></strong><a href="https://b23.tv/sKVZUBm" data-url="https://b23.tv/sKVZUBm"><strong><span>占星疗愈思思</span></strong></a><strong><span>”。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>shownotes：</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnyktBzTrYwMOroifnUduPvSlfhA.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu0kCImdytqavQtTWz_nLoyJn4VP.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3">00:03</a> 孙宇晨这次到底想干嘛？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="231">03:51</a> 先把这篇“我的女友景甜”捋一遍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">07:40</a> 当恋爱开始变成一张巨额账单</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="639">10:39</a> 事情最后还是进了法院</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="818">13:38</a> 孙宇晨不是突然变成孙宇晨的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="982">16:22</a> 孙割的流量玩法</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1086">18:06</a> 为什么大家最后只记住了指甲、胶布和私人飞机</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1285">21:25</a> 没人比我大胆，更没人比我谨慎</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1444">24:04</a> 从北大历史系到币圈：他是真的敢押</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1608">26:48</a> 名声臭不臭？可能根本不是他的KPI</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1790">29:50</a> “要么我被收割，要么我收割别人”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1921">32:01</a> 真正让人反感的，不只是官司，是“我要把你毁了”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2115">35:15</a> 为什么一个人会把世界看成敌我关系</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2373">39:33</a> 弱者翻身以后，不一定会同情弱者</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2589">43:09</a> 孙割的字典里没有“信任”二字</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2651">44:11</a> “穷得只剩钱”真正可怕的地方是什么</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2879">47:59</a> 巴菲特、香蕉、太空：是不是都在证明“哥们儿牛逼”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3090">51:30</a> 为什么“叫妈妈”这个细节那么刺眼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3305">55:05</a> “妈妈再爱我一次”的终极幻想</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3540">59:00</a> 孙割到底会不会进去？后续运势解读</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3775">01:02:55</a> 这个瓜吃到最后，给普通人的保命提醒</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3970">01:06:10</a> 真正的富足，不是你有多少，而是你没觉得全世界都欠你</span></p>]]></description>
